istry.AdapterType\",\"name\":\"adapterType\",\"type\":\"uint8\"}],\"name\":\"getAdaptersByType\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address[]\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address[]\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"getAllAdapters\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address[]\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address[]\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"getTotalAdapterCount\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"adapter\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"isSelectable\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"adapter\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"reason\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"name\":\"markDeprecated\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"adapter\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"auditReference\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"name\":\"markVerified\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"adapter\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"enum AdapterRegistry.AdapterType\",\"name\":\"adapterType\",\"type\":\"uint8\"}],\"name\":\"registerAdapter\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newGovernance\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"setAuditGovernance\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"details\":\"Hybrid model: registration is open to anyone, but the registry      attaches trust metadata (verified/unverified/deprecated) so market      creators can make informed choices. Verification is a PROCESS control \\u2014 it governs whether a human reviewer has vouched for the code. It does NOT change how the core engine treats the adapter at the code level. Both verified and unverified adapters are called identically, and the engine independently verifies their outputs. Deprecation does NOT retroactively pause markets already using the adapter. It blocks new selection, surfaces warnings on affected markets, and notifies affected LPs.\",\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"getAdapterInfo(address)\":{\"params\":{\"adapter\":\"Address of the adapter\"},\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"info Adapter information struct\"}},\"getAdaptersByType(uint8)\":{\"params\":{\"adapterType\":\"The type to filter by\"},\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"result Array of adapter addresses\"}},\"getAllAdapters()\":{\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"result Array of all adapter addresses\"}},\"getTotalAdapterCount()\":{\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"count Total adapter count\"}},\"isSelectable(address)\":{\"details\":\"An adapter is selectable if registered AND not deprecated\",\"params\":{\"adapter\":\"Address of the adapter\"},\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"selectable True if registered and not deprecated\"}},\"markDeprecated(address,string)\":{\"details\":\"Restricted to audit governance multisig.      Does NOT pause existing markets using this adapter.      Blocks selection in new markets + surfaces warnings.\",\"params\":{\"adapter\":\"Address of the adapter to deprecate\",\"reason\":\"Reason for deprecation\"}},\"markVerified(address,string)\":{\"details\":\"Restricted to audit governance multisig. The auditReference      should point to the audit firm/report identifier.\",\"params\":{\"adapter\":\"Address of the adapter to verify\",\"auditReference\":\"Audit firm/report identifier\"}},\"registerAdapter(address,uint8)\":{\"details\":\"Permissionless \\u2014 anyone can register an adapter conforming to      one of the five interfaces. Registration does NOT imply verification